{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We Gotta Go</strong> is a first person co-op horror game where you and your friends have to reach the only bathroom in a haunted mansion before your bowels betray you. <br><br>The mansion won\u2019t make it easy: its many passages are blocked, locked, hidden, and haunted... can your team survive all the way to the porcelain promised land?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/61ffe476c7e0cbeeb73b8e96bfe70d35.webp?t=1759975241\" width=242 height=28 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear, stress, and bad burritos all push your gut closer to disaster. Manage your bowels carefully... once you lose control, it\u2019s game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/5c269ed325aab898b90dc826f17bd478.webp?t=1759975241\" width=370 height=28 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water Ghosts, TP Mummies, and a host of other horrors lurk in the darkness, waiting to scare your pants off. Literally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/7002b488f7e5c7e6bb7660143d38eba1.webp?t=1759975241\" width=243 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light up lanterns, wield wonky weapons, and fling fancy furniture to break open doors and keep ghosts at bay (or just throw s#!t at your friends).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/08d8001a57a681926a8f64fa66f9ee5a.webp?t=1759975241\" width=129 height=28 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op with proximity voice chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based combat &amp; item chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural haunted mansion layouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable characters (yes, even after death)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge clothes from corpses to mix up your style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Die, and return as a playable pile of poo</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3967470?t=1759975241","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/774a03baa9e7d570ce752fb87f9a12d1d098d2f3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759975241","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/6a174362852862cee0a7ee0a2633377064db9512/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759975241","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/6a174362852862cee0a7ee0a2633377064db9512/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759975241","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We Gotta Go</strong> is a first person co-op horror game where you and your friends have to reach the only bathroom in a haunted mansion before your bowels betray you. <br><br>The mansion won\u2019t make it easy: its many passages are blocked, locked, hidden, and haunted... can your team survive all the way to the porcelain promised land?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item